<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Traditional Web App</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { 
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e94560 0%, #0f3460 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .badge {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .card h2 { margin-bottom: 15px; color: #0f3460; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: #e94560; color: white; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #0f3460; color: white; }
    .btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
    .user-info { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
    .avatar {
      width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e94560; color: white;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      border-left: 4px solid #e94560;
    }
    .info-box ul { padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .info-box li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>📄 Traditional Web App</h1>
      <span class="badge">Server-Rendered Pages + Server-Side Sessions</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Welcome</h2>
      <% if (user) { %>
        <div class="user-info">
          <div class="avatar"><%= user.name ? user.name.charAt(0) : '?' %></div>
          <div>
            <strong><%= user.name %></strong><br>
            <small><%= user.email %></small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-secondary">View Protected Docs</a>
          <a href="/auth/logout" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-left: 10px;">Logout</a>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Welcome to the traditional web app. This demonstrates server-rendered pages with authentication.</p>
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-primary">Login to Access Docs</a>
        <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-left: 10px;">Try Accessing Docs</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>How Traditional Web Auth Works</h2>
      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>🔒 Classic Server-Side Pattern:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>All pages are server-rendered (HTML from server)</li>
          <li>Authentication checked on every request</li>
          <li>Tokens stored in server-side session only</li>
          <li>Browser only has a session cookie (HttpOnly)</li>
          <li>No JavaScript required for auth flow</li>
          <li>Perfect for: docs sites, admin consoles, traditional apps</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
